{
  "repo": "HYDRA-UMC-CONNECTOR-HUB",
  "ecosystem": "hydra",
  "tagline": "Adapter manifests in, a read-only catalogue, the SDK gate and a sealed certification record out.",
  "description": "HYDRA-UMC-CONNECTOR-HUB is a registry of adapter manifests for external machines. It validates each manifest against one contract, serves the catalogue read only, passes a requested capability through the real evaluate_job gate of HYDRA-UMC-SDK and records a human-attested certification in a hash-chained log. It never touches a machine: it has no network write path and does not check the evidence against real hardware.",
